   ask:["How old is it, and how long do they live?","What happens to the revenue when it dies?"],
   watch:"The horizon is the first number you need and the one people forget to ask for.",
   attempt:{q:"Propose a way to date it and you are told: it is 21 years old and the expected lifespan is 50. What is the project life?",
            a:"29 years, and then nothing — it can't reproduce, so the cash flows stop dead rather than "
             +"continuing at a lower level. That is unusual and it matters: there is no terminal value "
             +"and no residual business."},
   src:"The dinosaur is the size of an elephant; it can easily be transported; it cannot reproduce; it "
